flowchart LR
    A([Call Center Intake]) --> B{Patient identified?}
    B -- No --> C[Register patient<br/>MRN + Ticket]
    B -- Yes --> D[Queue &amp; Dispatch]
    C --> D

    D --> E{Provider type}
    E -- MBBS --> F[Primary care<br/>vitals + ICD-10]
    E -- Specialist --> G[Consultation<br/>video + DICOM]
    E -- Field staff --> H[Field visit<br/>GPS + check-in]

    F --> I[Diagnostics<br/>Sonologist / X-Ray]
    G --> I
    H --> I

    I --> J[Invoice &amp; Payment]
    J --> K[Report + Receipt]
    K --> L([Care Complete])
